   {
    "name": "Hero",
    "blocks": [
     "Keep your plants alive without the nagging.",
     "Add a plant by photo or name. Say which way the window faces and how far the plant sits from it. Fernlight sets the schedule and reminds you only on watering day."
    ]
   },
   {
    "name": "Value",
    "blocks": [
     "For anyone who has watered too much, or too little.",
